The gear, gearbox, motor, Peg Perego gearbox and screw libraries vendored the way upstream's
own files expect them, under an AuroraSCAD/ directory. motor.scad includes
<../AuroraSCAD/screw.scad>, so the parent directory has to be named AuroraSCAD. Upstream's
README states that everything here is released to the public domain unless noted otherwise.
sprocket.scad is NOT vendored because its header says it derives from a CC BY-NC roller-chain
sprocket module, and upstream's own PolyGear/ tree (used by gear_poly.scad) is CC BY-SA 4.0,
so neither is redistributable here. bearing.scad is not vendored either, because none of the
catalog objects use it and this repository does not carry unused vendored files.
The upstream Unlicense LICENSE text is copied verbatim from the pinned commit.

